The default-off `--additional-axioms` option supplies bounded integer/bitvector round trips, allowing wide conversions to verify without extra range assertions. It can also be enabled in project files. Conversion legality checks are unchanged. Direct round trips are gated on Z3 4.12.1 and 5.1.0; indirect goals remain solver-dependent (the original shift-by-zero example passes on 5.1.0 but exhausts its cap on 4.12.1).
